WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:13.101
I wish my mom could always be waiting for me when I get home from school.

2
00:00:13.102 --> 00:00:14.647
Hana: I'm home, Mom.

3
00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:16.398
Where are you?

4
00:00:16.399 --> 00:00:18.190
Mom: I'm in the kitchen.

5
00:00:18.191 --> 00:00:20.200
You're home early.

6
00:00:20.201 --> 00:00:23.191
Hana: The teacher let us out early today.

7
00:00:23.192 --> 00:00:24.696
Mom: That's right.

8
00:00:24.697 --> 00:00:26.713
It was your first day.

9
00:00:26.714 --> 00:00:28.416
How was your class?

10
00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:31.671
Hana: It was fun.

11
00:00:31.672 --> 00:00:34.028
Mom: Did you make many new friends?

12
00:00:34.029 --> 00:00:39.530
Hana: Oh yes. A girl named Susan sits by me.

13
00:00:39.531 --> 00:00:42.964
Mom: Susan? Invite her over sometime.

14
00:00:42.965 --> 00:00:45.876
Mom: By the way, what's your teacher's name?

15
00:00:45.877 --> 00:00:50.111
Hana: Hmm. I forgot.

16
00:00:50.112 --> 00:00:52.855
I'll find out tomorrow.

17
00:00:52.856 --> 00:00:56.004
I am not very good with names.

18
00:00:56.005 --> 00:01:00.365
But I did remember my partner Susan's name.
